msgid "驱动与存储部件"
msgstr "Drivers and storage components"

msgid "职责"
msgstr "Responsibilities"

msgid ""
"drivers/ 按 console、tty、video、storage、net、input、usb、sound 等设备族 组织；sound/core "
"实现 PCM、mixer 及 ALSA/OSS 路线。block/ 负责块 I/O、GPT/MBR 与 设备身份，fs/ "
"各文件系统负责自己的元数据、缓存和同步。 默认生产配置全部内置；下表中的部件可选择 ``m``，使用相同的原生注册、 探测和撤销入口。模块针对匹配的 "
"ReliefNT 构建，不兼容 Linux 原版二进制 模块。构建、安装和树外模块 SDK 见 :doc:`../kbuild/modules`。"
msgstr ""
"The drivers/ tree is organized into device families such as console, tty, "
"video, storage, net, input, usb, and sound; sound/core implements PCM, "
"mixer, and the ALSA/OSS paths. block/ handles block I/O, GPT/MBR, and device"
" identity, while each filesystem in fs/ manages its own metadata, caches, "
"and synchronization. The default production configuration builds everything "
"in; the components in the table below can be set to ``m`` and use the same "
"native registration, probing, and teardown entry points. Modules target a "
"matching ReliefNT build and are not compatible with upstream Linux binary "
"modules. See :doc:`../kbuild/modules` for building, installation, and the "
"out-of-tree module SDK."

msgid "模块边界"
msgstr "Module boundaries"

msgid "可模块化生产部件"
msgstr "Modular production components"

msgid "Kconfig"
msgstr "Kconfig"

msgid "模块"
msgstr "Module"

msgid "归属与约束"
msgstr "Ownership and constraints"

msgid "``SATA_AHCI`` / ``PATA_IDE`` / ``BLK_DEV_NVME``"
msgstr "``SATA_AHCI`` / ``PATA_IDE`` / ``BLK_DEV_NVME``"

msgid "``ahci`` / ``ide`` / ``nvme``"
msgstr "``ahci`` / ``ide`` / ``nvme``"

msgid "原生控制器、IRQ 和 DMA；根设备引用阻止卸载。"
msgstr ""
"Native controllers, IRQs, and DMA; references to the root device prevent "
"unloading."

msgid "``E1000``"
msgstr "``E1000``"

msgid "``e1000``"
msgstr "``e1000``"

msgid "PRO/1000 设备；网络协议栈和回调入口保留内置。"
msgstr ""
"PRO/1000 devices; the network protocol stack and callback entry points "
"remain built in."

msgid "``E1000E``"
msgstr "``E1000E``"

msgid "``e1000e``"
msgstr "``e1000e``"

msgid ""
"Intel 82574L/82574IT、82583V PCIe 千兆网卡；每个 PCI 功能独立注册 网络接口。设备范围和验证边界见 "
":doc:`e1000e`。"
msgstr ""
"Intel 82574L/82574IT and 82583V PCIe Gigabit Ethernet adapters; each PCI "
"function registers its own network interface. See :doc:`e1000e` for device "
"coverage and validation boundaries."

msgid "``R8169``"
msgstr "``R8169``"

msgid "``r8169``"
msgstr "``r8169``"

msgid ""
"Realtek RTL8111/8168 千兆与 RTL8125 2.5GbE PCIe 网卡；每个 PCI 功能 "
"独立注册网络接口。芯片版本、固件来源和验证范围见 :doc:`realtek`。"
msgstr ""
"Realtek RTL8111/8168 Gigabit and RTL8125 2.5GbE PCIe adapters; each PCI "
"function registers its own network interface. See :doc:`realtek` for chip "
"revisions, firmware sources, and validation coverage."

msgid "``MOUSE_PS2`` / ``USB_UHCI_HCD``"
msgstr "``MOUSE_PS2`` / ``USB_UHCI_HCD``"

msgid "``mouse`` / ``uhci``"
msgstr "``mouse`` / ``uhci``"

msgid "PS/2、VMware 鼠标与 UHCI HID；键盘基础输入和分发入口内置。"
msgstr ""
"PS/2 and VMware mice, and UHCI HID; basic keyboard input and dispatch entry "
"points are built in."

msgid "``USB_EHCI_HCD``"
msgstr "``USB_EHCI_HCD``"

msgid "``ehci``"
msgstr "``ehci``"

msgid ""
"USB 2.0 高速主机、BOT/SCSI 存储与 boot HID；挂载或打开的块设备固定模块。 低速/全速根端口设备使用 UHCI "
"companion，详见 :doc:`usb`。"
msgstr ""
"USB 2.0 high-speed hosts, BOT/SCSI storage, and boot HID; mounted or open "
"block devices pin the module. Low-speed/full-speed root-port devices use a "
"UHCI companion; see :doc:`usb`."

msgid "``SERIAL_8250``"
msgstr "``SERIAL_8250``"

msgid "``serial``"
msgstr "``serial``"

msgid "COM1 终端提供者；早期诊断与 panic 输出不依赖模块。"
msgstr ""
"COM1 terminal provider; early diagnostics and panic output do not depend on "
"the module."

msgid "``SND``"
msgstr "``SND``"

msgid "``snd``"
msgstr "``snd``"

msgid "ALSA/OSS、PCM 与 mixer；通用字符设备入口内置。"
msgstr ""
"ALSA/OSS, PCM, and mixer; generic character-device entry points are built "
"in."

msgid "``SND_HDA_INTEL`` / ``SND_INTEL8X0`` / ``SND_ENS1371``"
msgstr "``SND_HDA_INTEL`` / ``SND_INTEL8X0`` / ``SND_ENS1371``"

msgid "``hda`` / ``ac97`` / ``es1371``"
msgstr "``hda`` / ``ac97`` / ``es1371``"

msgid "依赖 sound core，Kconfig 限制驱动的链接等级不高于 core。"
msgstr ""
"Depend on the sound core; Kconfig prevents a driver's linkage level from "
"exceeding that of the core."

msgid "``DRM``"
msgstr "``DRM``"

msgid "``drm``"
msgstr "``drm``"

msgid "DRM/vmwgfx 服务、资源与映射；启动 framebuffer 和文本控制台内置。"
msgstr ""
"DRM/vmwgfx services, resources, and mappings; the boot framebuffer and text "
"console are built in."

msgid "``FAT_FS`` / ``EXFAT_FS`` / ``ISO9660_FS``"
msgstr "``FAT_FS`` / ``EXFAT_FS`` / ``ISO9660_FS``"

msgid "``vfat`` / ``exfat`` / ``isofs``"
msgstr "``vfat`` / ``exfat`` / ``isofs``"

msgid "对应文件系统；ISO9660 只读，格式化仅在对应实现支持时提供。"
msgstr ""
"The respective filesystems; ISO9660 is read-only, and formatting is "
"available only where the corresponding implementation supports it."

msgid "``EXT2_FS`` / ``EXT4_FS``"
msgstr "``EXT2_FS`` / ``EXT4_FS``"

msgid "``ext2`` / ``ext4``，共同依赖 ``ext_common``"
msgstr "``ext2`` / ``ext4``, both depending on ``ext_common``"

msgid "各自注册文件系统类型，共用实际 ext 引擎。隐藏公共选项取所需最高链接等级。"
msgstr ""
"Each registers its own filesystem type and shares the actual ext engine. The"
" hidden common option takes the highest linkage level required."

msgid ""
"所有表中生产选项在 defconfig 中为 ``y``。``MODULE_TESTS`` 的 provider、 "
"consumer、参数和故障模块只供显式测试，不作为生产设备或默认加载策略。 ``allmodconfig`` "
"会同时打开测试选项；生成了测试模块不表示它们应自动加载。"
msgstr ""
"All production options in the table are ``y`` in defconfig. The provider, "
"consumer, parameter, and fault modules under ``MODULE_TESTS`` are for "
"explicit testing only, not production devices or a default loading policy. "
"``allmodconfig`` also enables the test options; generating test modules does"
" not mean they should be loaded automatically."

msgid ""
"调度、物理内存、页表、模块加载器、VFS/挂载树、通用设备注册与设备映射、 IRQ、DMA 分配及网络协议栈保持内置。初始 newc "
"根、内存块设备、tmpfs、proc、 sysfs 和 devfs 为启动与模块管理提供基础，也保持内置。这些核心没有独立的 "
"可卸载生命周期，不提供无法安全使用的 ``m`` 选项。"
msgstr ""
"Scheduling, physical memory, page tables, the module loader, VFS/mount "
"trees, generic device registration and device mappings, IRQs, DMA "
"allocation, and the network protocol stack remain built in. The initial newc"
" root, memory block devices, tmpfs, proc, sysfs, and devfs provide the "
"foundation for boot and module management and also remain built in. These "
"core components have no independent unloadable lifecycle and do not offer an"
" ``m`` option that cannot be used safely."

msgid ""
"``net/services/`` 的 DHCP、DNS、NTP 和旧同步 HTTP 客户端辅助代码仍属于 内置网络栈。这里没有独立的 HTTP "
"服务注册入口；HTTP 文件还提供普通 TCP 连接使用的地址解析帮助函数，不能把整个文件改成 ``m`` 后留下内置调用者。 "
"因此它不属于上述生产模块集合，也不显示尚不能安全装卸的配置选项。"
msgstr ""
"DHCP, DNS, NTP, and the legacy synchronous HTTP client helpers in "
"``net/services/`` remain part of the built-in network stack. There is no "
"separate HTTP service registration entry point here; the HTTP file also "
"provides address-resolution helpers used by ordinary TCP connections, so the"
" entire file cannot be changed to ``m`` while leaving built-in callers. It "
"is therefore outside the production module set above, and no configuration "
"option is exposed until safe loading and unloading are possible."

msgid "生命周期与引用"
msgstr "Lifecycle and references"

msgid ""
"设备注册记录包含实现 owner，外部引用与正在执行的回调分别固定原始模块。 注册动作本身不建立永久自引用，未发现硬件时允许模块注册成功但不绑定设备。 "
"是否激活硬件应查看驱动和设备状态，不能只看 ``/proc/modules`` 的 LIVE。"
msgstr ""
"Device registration records include the implementation owner; external "
"references and executing callbacks each pin the original module. "
"Registration itself does not establish a permanent self-reference, and a "
"module may register successfully without binding a device when no hardware "
"is found. Check driver and device state to determine whether hardware is "
"active; a LIVE state in ``/proc/modules`` alone is insufficient."

msgid ""
"卸载先拒绝新的使用者，再停止 IRQ/DMA、排空回调并释放资源，最后释放代码。 硬件未确认停止时保留代码和 "
"backing，报告失败并允许诊断或重试。打开文件、 挂载、用户映射、fork 后的映射、异步音频工作与 GPU fence 都必须保留对应 "
"实现；不通过强制卸载绕过这些引用，也不将模块静态区直接当作连续 DMA 内存。"
msgstr ""
"Unloading first rejects new users, then stops IRQs/DMA, drains callbacks, "
"and releases resources before finally releasing the code. If the hardware "
"has not been confirmed stopped, code and backing storage are retained, "
"failure is reported, and diagnosis or retry remains possible. Open files, "
"mounts, user mappings, mappings inherited through fork, asynchronous audio "
"work, and GPU fences must all retain the corresponding implementation; "
"forced unloading does not bypass these references, and a module's static "
"storage must not be used directly as contiguous DMA memory."

msgid "磁盘与显示"
msgstr "Disks and display"

msgid ""
"原始块写入遵守打开时 DAC、描述符模式与权限；重读分区表要求 CAP_SYS_ADMIN。 FAT 目录按需有界分配，长文件名按 UTF-16 "
"wire 数据处理，不能使用未对齐主机读取。 默认 root 的 PARTUUID 选择与磁盘编号分开。"
msgstr ""
"Raw block writes honor the DAC checks at open time, descriptor mode, and "
"permissions; rereading a partition table requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN. FAT "
"directories use bounded allocation on demand, and long filenames are handled"
" as UTF-16 wire data without unaligned host reads. The default root PARTUUID"
" selection is independent of disk numbering."

msgid ""
"framebuffer 提供基本显示；DRM/vmwgfx 实现有界 SVGA-II/VGPU9 能力、资源、 命令验证与 fence，不承诺通用跨设备"
" DMA-BUF、atomic modesetting 或硬件 vblank。 未得到设备能力时不能伪造 render 节点或成功状态。"
msgstr ""
"The framebuffer provides basic display; DRM/vmwgfx implements bounded SVGA-"
"II/VGPU9 capabilities, resources, command validation, and fences, without "
"promising general cross-device DMA-BUF, atomic modesetting, or hardware "
"vblank. Render nodes or successful status must not be fabricated when device"
" capabilities are unavailable."
